      "text": "runApp\n\n读取配置 进入结构体\nc, err := conf.ReadConfig(path.GetConfigFilePath())\n\n初始化程序\ninitApplication\n\n按照这样的顺序初始化\nData → Repo → Service → Controller → Router → HTTP Server",
